spice
* NMOS transistors: Drain, Gate, Source, Body
M1 4 6 3 3 NMOS
M2 5 6 3 3 NMOS
M3 4 3 5 5 NMOS
M4 5 4 5 5 NMOS
M6 2 5 3 3 NMOS
M7 2 3 2 2 NMOS

* PMOS transistor: Drain, Gate, Source, Body
M5 6 4 5 5 PMOS

* Current Source
I1 3 5 DC 200uA

* Voltage Sources
VDD 5 0 DC 0.9V
VSS 2 0 DC -0.9V

* Model definitions (example model definitions)
.model NMOS NMOS
.model PMOS PMOS
.end